{"id": "section-body-19191", "title": "Angular Deformity of the limbs", "chapterId": "chapter-seventeen", "blocks": [{"id": "body-19191", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading2", "text": "Angular Deformity of the limbs", "runs": [{"text": "Angular"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Deformity"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "the"}, {"text": " limbs"}], "level": 2, "list": {"level": 1, "numberingId": "1048"}}, {"id": "body-19193", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Rickets", "runs": [{"text": "Rickets"}], "level": 4, "list": {"level": 2, "numberingId": "1048"}}, {"id": "body-19194", "type": "paragraph", "style": "BodyText", "text": "Refers to softening and weakening of bones in children, usually due to vitamin D deficiency. Vitamin D promotes the body’s absorption of calcium and phosphorus. Extreme or prolonged lack of vitamin D makes it difficult to maintain proper calcium and phosphorus levels in bones, which can cause rickets.", "runs": [{"text": "Refers to softening and weakening of bones in children, usually due to vitamin D deficiency. Vitamin D promotes the body’s absorption"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "calcium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "phosphorus."}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "Extreme"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "or"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "prolonged"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "lack"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "vitamin"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "D"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "makes"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "it"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "difficult"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "to"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "maintain"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "proper"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "calcium"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "and phosphorus levels in bones, which can cause rickets."}]}, {"id": "body-19197", "type": "heading", "style": "Heading4", "text": "Types of Rickets", "runs": [{"text": "Types"}, {"text": " "}, {"text": "of"}, {"text": " "}, {"